WEBVTT

00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:21.729
You're taking
a vacation from normalcy.

00:00:21.814 --> 00:00:25.692
The setting, a weird motel where
the bed is stained with mystery,

00:00:25.776 --> 00:00:28.194
and there's also some
mystery floating in the pool.

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:31.280
Your key card may not open
the exercise room

00:00:31.365 --> 00:00:33.282
because someone smeared
mystery on the lock.

00:00:33.492 --> 00:00:35.952
But it will open
the Scary Door.

00:00:36.912 --> 00:00:38.913
Submitted for your
Emmy consideration,

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:42.083
a popular senator
with unpopular ideas.

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:45.128
There is no such thing
as space aliens!

00:00:45.295 --> 00:00:47.922
Oh! How can you be
so sure

00:00:48.006 --> 00:00:50.425
them aliens ain't
already among us?

00:00:50.509 --> 00:00:52.385
I'll tell you how!

00:00:52.469 --> 00:00:54.470
Because you are one!

00:01:00.986 --> 00:01:02.612
Hey, I was watching that!

00:01:02.696 --> 00:01:04.739
The Saints just needed
a field goal to tie!

00:01:04.823 --> 00:01:08.951
Lrrr, you lazy ruler of the
planet Omicron Persei 8!

00:01:09.036 --> 00:01:10.953
You said you would conquer a planet today,

00:01:11.038 --> 00:01:13.414
but you have not even
shed your skin yet.

00:01:13.499 --> 00:01:17.126
Yes, Ndnd. I heard you
the first hundred times.

00:01:17.211 --> 00:01:18.628
I'll conquer
something tomorrow

00:01:18.712 --> 00:01:22.298
after I fuel up on one of your
disgusting egg-white omelets.

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:26.344
You want yolks? Fine!
Enjoy your stroke.

00:01:34.311 --> 00:01:37.146
I am conquering Erth!

00:01:37.231 --> 00:01:39.482
Not so fast,
Invader X!

00:01:39.566 --> 00:01:42.568
Here comes
Delivery-Boy Man!

00:01:42.653 --> 00:01:46.989
Special deliver for Invader X! Laser eye power!

00:01:49.618 --> 00:01:51.369
Hand magnet power!

00:01:53.205 --> 00:01:54.872
Yay! I'm unbuckled!

00:01:56.625 --> 00:01:58.501
Stop it, you hero!

00:01:58.585 --> 00:01:59.919
Reverse-time power!

00:02:03.298 --> 00:02:04.590
It's earlier now.

00:02:09.263 --> 00:02:11.055
So? What do you
think of my comic?

00:02:11.139 --> 00:02:12.390
Let me put it like this.

00:02:12.474 --> 00:02:15.309
After I leave here,
I'm getting a memory enema.

00:02:15.394 --> 00:02:17.854
If I might offer
some constructive criticism,

00:02:17.938 --> 00:02:19.522
there was never
any real peril.

00:02:19.606 --> 00:02:22.650
I mean, the delivery guy has,
like, 30 superpowers.

00:02:22.734 --> 00:02:25.611
Well, that's because he was
bitten by a radioactive superman!

00:02:25.946 --> 00:02:28.364
This is wonderful!

00:02:28.448 --> 00:02:29.866
It is, isn't it?

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:31.492
Wait, those are the ads.

00:02:31.577 --> 00:02:35.538
These X-ray specs will really
take the guesswork out of surgery.

00:02:35.622 --> 00:02:38.082
No more chopping
blindly in the goop.

00:02:38.166 --> 00:02:40.042
Don't waste your
allowance, Zoidberg.

00:02:40.127 --> 00:02:42.295
This stuff is
butt-grade crap.

00:02:42.379 --> 00:02:45.131
Amuse your friends
with real vomit!

00:02:45.299 --> 00:02:46.340
Throw your voice!

00:02:46.425 --> 00:02:47.425
Sea monkeys!

00:02:47.509 --> 00:02:48.801
Throw your sea monkeys!

00:02:48.886 --> 00:02:51.637
My disintegrator
ray really works!

00:02:51.847 --> 00:02:52.889
But that's you.

00:02:52.973 --> 00:02:54.557
That's how I know
it's bunkum.

00:02:54.641 --> 00:02:57.727
The Farnsworth Novelty
Disintegrator Ray is nothing more

00:02:57.811 --> 00:02:59.645
than a common teleporter ray.

00:03:04.401 --> 00:03:06.319
Worthless toy!

00:03:06.403 --> 00:03:09.071
I'm sick of being critiqued
by nitpicking nerds.

00:03:09.156 --> 00:03:11.490
I'm taking this
to a comic book convention!

00:03:19.333 --> 00:03:20.917
it's crowded!

00:03:21.001 --> 00:03:23.669
Good thing everyone is
freshly bathed and groomed.

00:03:24.504 --> 00:03:25.838
Oooh!

00:03:27.424 --> 00:03:29.675
What are you doing? That's
the rare Zapp Brannigan

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:31.344
with recording
session blooper!

00:03:32.012 --> 00:03:35.181
Don't tell me how to do the line. It sickens me.

00:03:35.307 --> 00:03:38.517
But the sign said
there was a mint in the box.

00:03:43.649 --> 00:03:45.358
Thank you so... Okay, thanks. Thanks so...

00:03:45.442 --> 00:03:46.442
Settle down!

00:03:46.526 --> 00:03:50.196
So, anyway, we're really excited to show
you guys the pilot for our new series.

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:53.741
It's set in the year 4000,
and we call it Futurella!

00:04:05.545 --> 00:04:08.255
Wow. Fox has really
streamlined the process.

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:09.882
Matt will now
take questions.

00:04:09.967 --> 00:04:11.884
But please, only about
Futurella,

00:04:11.969 --> 00:04:13.135
not
The Simpsons.

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:15.888
Yes? The robot standing on
the small child over there?

00:04:15.973 --> 00:04:18.432
Yeah, when are you
going to make

00:04:18.517 --> 00:04:20.226
a second Simpsons movie?

00:04:25.023 --> 00:04:27.942
Mr. Aragonйs, I'm a big fan of your cartoons

00:04:28.026 --> 00:04:29.026
and your mustache.

00:04:29.111 --> 00:04:32.446
You want it? Take it. It's
brought me nothing but misery.

00:04:32.531 --> 00:04:34.031
Wow. Thanks!

00:04:35.659 --> 00:04:37.493
If you could just
quiet down, I wanted

00:04:37.577 --> 00:04:39.328
to get your opinion
of my comic book.

00:04:39.413 --> 00:04:42.790
Seсor, anyone who still
writes comics is a hero to me.

00:04:44.334 --> 00:04:45.960
Mmm. It stinks.

00:04:47.254 --> 00:04:51.048
But, um, I do like the
tiny doodles in the margins.

00:04:51.133 --> 00:04:53.676
Oh, that's just some relish
from a hot dog I found.

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:55.845
Attention,
ladies and gentleboys,

00:04:55.929 --> 00:04:58.681
the costume contest
is about to begin.

00:04:58.765 --> 00:05:02.226
The costume contest!
The costume contest!

00:05:07.691 --> 00:05:09.567
Yeah! Devo!

00:05:11.111 --> 00:05:12.820
What the hell are
you supposed to be?

00:05:12.904 --> 00:05:15.281
Every nerd's fantasy, baby.

00:05:15.782 --> 00:05:18.409
Next up,
contestant number 36!

00:05:25.959 --> 00:05:28.127
Contestant 36, everyone!

00:05:28.211 --> 00:05:30.296
Next up, contestant...

00:05:39.389 --> 00:05:41.348
I am Lrrr,
ruler of the planet...

00:05:41.433 --> 00:05:42.975
Hold on a second,
let me just get this.

00:05:44.686 --> 00:05:48.773
I am Lrrr, ruler of
the planet Omicron Persei 8.

00:05:48.857 --> 00:05:51.817
You are hereby conquered!
Please line up

00:05:51.902 --> 00:05:54.612
in order of how much beryllium
it takes to kill you!

00:06:00.827 --> 00:06:02.328
Damn,
that's a good costume.

00:06:02.662 --> 00:06:05.581
Next up, contestant 38!

00:06:06.792 --> 00:06:08.000
I don't understand.

00:06:08.085 --> 00:06:11.545
Why are the humans still eating their
soft pretzels instead of surrendering?

00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:13.756
They're probably just
waiting for Joss Whedon.

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.633
Joss Whedon's here?

00:06:15.717 --> 00:06:17.384
Wait a minute.
You look familiar.

00:06:17.677 --> 00:06:19.512
Yeah,
you almost ate me once.

00:06:19.679 --> 00:06:21.388
I was in your mouth
for five minutes.

00:06:21.556 --> 00:06:22.556
Leela?

00:06:22.849 --> 00:06:24.266
And the winner is

00:06:24.518 --> 00:06:26.018
Nerdgasma!

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:28.604
Whoo!
I got fruit boobs!

00:06:28.855 --> 00:06:31.690
What's the use?

00:06:38.990 --> 00:06:40.658
Now what?

00:06:40.742 --> 00:06:42.535
I send you out
to conquer a planet,

00:06:42.619 --> 00:06:45.287
and all you bring back
is J.J. Abrams' face?

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:46.747
I thought you'd like it.

00:06:46.957 --> 00:06:48.457
You haven't
even tried it on.

00:06:48.542 --> 00:06:52.044
I might dress up in a face if
you ever took me anywhere nice!

00:06:52.379 --> 00:06:53.963
Oh, boy, here we go.

00:06:54.047 --> 00:06:57.007
I built this castle
with my own two slaves!

00:06:57.092 --> 00:06:59.176
What are you
gonna do, kick me out?

00:07:05.016 --> 00:07:09.061
I am Lrrr, ruler of the planet Omicron Persei 8!

00:07:09.896 --> 00:07:11.355
May I crash on your couch?

00:07:17.529 --> 00:07:20.948
So he just showed up unannounced,
raided the liquor cabinet,

00:07:21.032 --> 00:07:24.160
sprayed urine on the ceiling
and passed out?

00:07:24.244 --> 00:07:25.327
And the walls.

00:07:26.788 --> 00:07:27.913
Leave me alone.

00:07:28.123 --> 00:07:31.584
My wife hates me and planetary
conquest has become a chore.

00:07:31.668 --> 00:07:35.963
There, there. You're just having a midlife crisis.

00:07:36.464 --> 00:07:37.756
Midlife crisis, eh?

00:07:38.425 --> 00:07:41.760
Lrrr demands the comfort of
pop-psychological platitudes!

00:07:41.845 --> 00:07:43.804
Look, hoss,
your wife threw you out.

00:07:44.014 --> 00:07:45.723
That's your license
to be a jerk.

00:07:45.974 --> 00:07:47.224
Do whatever
the hell you want,

00:07:47.309 --> 00:07:49.185
then walk away
and light a cigar.

00:07:50.437 --> 00:07:53.606
Don't listen to him, Lrrr.
Bender may seem happy

00:07:56.234 --> 00:07:58.527
but long-term,
you need to reinvest

00:07:58.612 --> 00:08:00.279
in your relationship
with Ndnd.

00:08:00.822 --> 00:08:03.324
Yes, it's clear
what I must do.

00:08:19.799 --> 00:08:20.925
I like it.

00:08:24.304 --> 00:08:25.846
I'm thinking we
need to downplay

00:08:25.931 --> 00:08:28.307
those hideous
growths on your head.

00:08:29.184 --> 00:08:30.643
Horns are a sign of virility.

00:08:30.977 --> 00:08:32.561
Also, they house my testes.

00:08:32.896 --> 00:08:35.105
I'm thinking horn extensions.

00:08:39.986 --> 00:08:41.278
You need
some arm candy.

00:08:41.363 --> 00:08:45.324
It's the perfect accessory for
out-of-shape middle-aged creeps like you.

00:08:45.659 --> 00:08:48.452
Yeah, I said it!
What's your type, Borgnine?

00:08:48.662 --> 00:08:50.287
Big and angry.

00:08:56.795 --> 00:08:58.963
Look, brah,
you're just not gonna find

00:08:59.047 --> 00:09:01.590
a lot of hot, gigantic
Omicronian babes

00:09:01.675 --> 00:09:02.841
in this solar system.

00:09:02.926 --> 00:09:04.051
There's one!

00:09:08.348 --> 00:09:10.641
Hey, cool cape.
Where'd you get that?

00:09:10.725 --> 00:09:12.017
What, this old thing?

00:09:12.227 --> 00:09:13.769
I murdered my father.

00:09:13.853 --> 00:09:17.189
My name's Lrrr, ruler of
the planet Omicron Persei 8.

00:09:17.565 --> 00:09:18.941
I am called Grrl.

00:09:19.025 --> 00:09:21.068
Of the planet
Omicron Persei 8?

00:09:21.403 --> 00:09:23.153
That is a pretty name!

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:28.575
What's on the TV tonight?

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:29.994
Oh, wait! I don't care,

00:09:30.078 --> 00:09:31.787
because I got a date!

00:09:31.871 --> 00:09:33.664
I know it's not
what you want to hear,

00:09:33.748 --> 00:09:35.291
but I think
this is a mistake.

00:09:35.375 --> 00:09:36.458
Leela's right.

00:09:36.543 --> 00:09:38.085
That's not what
you want to hear.

00:09:38.169 --> 00:09:40.546
What you want to hear is
that I fixed my comic book.

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:42.006
Now the hero is
more relatable

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:43.966
because he has no
ridiculous powers.

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:45.592
Let's watch, shall we?

00:09:46.303 --> 00:09:47.303
One more step

00:09:47.387 --> 00:09:50.514
and little Miss Constructive
Criticism here gets it!

00:09:50.598 --> 00:09:54.560
Oh, yeah? I may be just a simple
delivery boy with no superpowers,

00:09:54.644 --> 00:09:56.603
so there's nothing I can do.

00:09:56.688 --> 00:09:57.688
Okay.

00:10:02.569 --> 00:10:04.695
So? Give me
your honest praise.

00:10:04.779 --> 00:10:08.115
Fry, I've now seen two
comic books, so listen to me.

00:10:08.199 --> 00:10:10.993
Why should I care about the
hero when all he does is cry?

00:10:16.666 --> 00:10:20.085
Hmm. That dinner
was a worthy foe.

00:10:20.170 --> 00:10:22.880
Yes, we shall not
see its like again.

00:10:23.631 --> 00:10:25.174
So, um...

00:10:30.847 --> 00:10:34.350
Um, I'm sorry. I haven't
done this for a while.

00:10:34.434 --> 00:10:36.894
I just got partway out
of a bad relationship.

00:10:37.562 --> 00:10:39.188
Maybe I should
take this off.

00:10:45.028 --> 00:10:46.653
You're a human?

00:10:46.738 --> 00:10:47.863
Only physically.

00:10:47.947 --> 00:10:49.448
I'm a cross-species dresser.

00:10:49.824 --> 00:10:52.534
Wait, you're an
actual Omicronian?

00:10:52.619 --> 00:10:54.495
Oh, God. Oh, God,
what have I done?

00:10:54.579 --> 00:10:56.372
This is so hot!

00:10:56.456 --> 00:10:58.040
Conquer me, Lrrr!

00:10:58.124 --> 00:11:01.126
Sharpen your horns
on my scaly thorax!

00:11:08.843 --> 00:11:10.302
I want to go home!

00:11:10.387 --> 00:11:12.846
But Ndnd would
never take me back now.

00:11:12.931 --> 00:11:16.058
Ndnd just wants
what every she-beast wants,

00:11:16.142 --> 00:11:18.268
to feel like you're
listening to her nagging.

00:11:18.353 --> 00:11:20.729
Is there anything she's been
riding your ass about?

00:11:21.689 --> 00:11:23.482
Conquering things, I guess.

00:11:23.650 --> 00:11:26.527
I could conquer Earth,
kill all humans.

00:11:26.611 --> 00:11:28.362
That's a thought.
No!

00:11:28.446 --> 00:11:30.447
We don't need
a war of the worlds.

00:11:30.532 --> 00:11:32.950
That's it! We need
a war of the worlds!

00:11:33.034 --> 00:11:34.451
I'll call Orson Welles.

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:38.122
Dork calling Orson!
Dork calling Orson!

00:11:41.084 --> 00:11:42.334
You're asking me,

00:11:42.419 --> 00:11:45.129
the renowned spokesman
for Paul Masson wine,

00:11:45.213 --> 00:11:48.799
to recreate my brilliant
1938 radio broadcast

00:11:48.883 --> 00:11:52.594
merely to deceive and impress
the wife of this skinny reptile?

00:11:52.679 --> 00:11:54.096
Sorry. Never mind.

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:55.347
I'll do it for free.

00:11:58.017 --> 00:12:00.352
Ladies and gentlemen,
we interrupt our program

00:12:00.437 --> 00:12:02.438
of The Jonas Brothers
and their orchestra

00:12:02.522 --> 00:12:04.064
to bring you
a special bulletin.

00:12:07.944 --> 00:12:11.029
We interrupt our program of The
Jonas brothers and their orchestra

00:12:11.114 --> 00:12:13.031
to bring you
a special bulletin.

00:12:13.116 --> 00:12:16.869
I'm speaking to you from the hickory
farms in Grover's Mall, New Jersey,

00:12:16.953 --> 00:12:18.829
through a mouthful
of summer sausage,

00:12:18.913 --> 00:12:22.124
mmm, where I hardly
know where to begin. Mmm!

00:12:22.542 --> 00:12:26.378
A huge spacecraft, piloted
by a devastatingly handsome...

00:12:26.463 --> 00:12:28.630
Now, how in God's name

00:12:28.715 --> 00:12:30.174
do I know
what the fellow looks like

00:12:30.258 --> 00:12:32.468
if he's inside a ship
miles in the air?

00:12:32.552 --> 00:12:34.344
It's just foolish
on its face.

00:12:34.429 --> 00:12:36.847
If you want the cheese log,
you'll read what I wrote.

00:12:36.931 --> 00:12:39.016
Very well.
I shall comply.

00:12:40.894 --> 00:12:42.769
I'm getting reports
that cities across the globe

00:12:42.896 --> 00:12:45.230
are being destroyed
by this noble invader,

00:12:45.356 --> 00:12:48.984
whose good looks are apparently
discernible across vast distances

00:12:49.068 --> 00:12:50.569
and through solid metal.

00:12:50.862 --> 00:12:54.239
But wait, the leader of the attack
is swaggering out of his ship

00:12:54.324 --> 00:12:57.326
and up to a convenient
nearby microphone.

00:12:57.869 --> 00:13:00.621
Now, why couldn't I have just
described his appearance at this point?

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:02.915
This is the type of
thing I'm talking about.

00:13:03.249 --> 00:13:07.377
People of Earth, I am Lrrr,
conqueror of your planet.

00:13:07.921 --> 00:13:09.087
Cue screams.

00:13:10.632 --> 00:13:12.799
You will now
remove your skulls

00:13:12.884 --> 00:13:15.469
and play dodgeball with them
for my amusement!

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:19.556
Ooh! I could swear
his horns have gotten longer!

00:13:23.269 --> 00:13:25.938
Sir, I've intercepted
an Earth broadcast.

00:13:26.022 --> 00:13:27.856
Put it up on the Zenith.

00:13:28.691 --> 00:13:29.775
Oh, God!

00:13:30.443 --> 00:13:31.818
Earth is conquered,

00:13:31.903 --> 00:13:34.530
the destruction
of civilization complete.

00:13:34.614 --> 00:13:37.282
Now stay tuned for
Little Orphan Annie.

00:13:38.117 --> 00:13:41.787
To hell with Little Orphan Annie
! We've got to do something.

00:13:42.288 --> 00:13:44.540
What's that, honey?
How many dead?

00:13:44.624 --> 00:13:47.084
I don't know, 80 million?

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:49.628
Okay. I love you, too.

00:13:50.046 --> 00:13:52.130
That was Ndnd.
She's taking me back!

00:13:54.133 --> 00:13:56.093
I'm sorry I've
been so difficult.

00:14:06.521 --> 00:14:10.148
So, you thought you could
conquer us so easily, eh?

00:14:10.650 --> 00:14:12.317
Nice job. We surrender.

00:14:13.319 --> 00:14:15.237
Earth is yours.

00:14:17.574 --> 00:14:18.824
Damn, I'm good.

00:14:18.992 --> 00:14:21.076
Now, may I please
have that cheese log?

00:14:25.832 --> 00:14:29.167
O glorious conqueror, permit
me to offer up a sacrifice.

00:14:29.586 --> 00:14:30.711
How about this?

00:14:31.838 --> 00:14:33.171
Hey!

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:35.465
Yeah, he'll do.

00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:37.509
Come on, Lrrr.
Show's over.

00:14:37.844 --> 00:14:39.011
Fine, okay.

00:14:39.304 --> 00:14:40.637
About this conquering thing,

00:14:42.140 --> 00:14:43.348
funny story...

00:14:49.522 --> 00:14:53.692
Hello, Lrrr.

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:56.570
Lrrr! Put a stop
to this right now!

00:14:56.654 --> 00:14:58.572
Okay! Okay! Quit nagging!

00:14:58.656 --> 00:15:01.950
Lrrr, why are you yelling softly
with the purple-furred one?

00:15:02.243 --> 00:15:04.202
Uh, it's nothing, my queen.

00:15:05.913 --> 00:15:07.289
He messed up my hair.

00:15:07.373 --> 00:15:08.624
I'm missing a leg!

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:10.542
We fought like hell, sir,

00:15:10.668 --> 00:15:13.920
but in the end, we caved like
a house of soufflй cards.

00:15:14.213 --> 00:15:16.048
Got it.
Peace with honor.

00:15:16.132 --> 00:15:17.633
Well, I resign again.

00:15:17.717 --> 00:15:18.759
Come, Nixon.

00:15:18.843 --> 00:15:20.802
Introduce me to
the kitchen staff.

00:15:20.887 --> 00:15:23.847
I must lay down the law
about Lrrr's low-sodium diet.

00:15:25.058 --> 00:15:26.475
You've got to
tell her the truth.

00:15:26.768 --> 00:15:28.518
And lay off
the salted peanuts!

00:15:28.603 --> 00:15:30.896
I'm just trying to get the
leg taste out of my mouth.

00:15:31.230 --> 00:15:35.233
Lrrr! I'm in here now,
not out there!

00:15:35.401 --> 00:15:36.485
Give me a little time.

00:15:36.569 --> 00:15:39.529
With a lady like Ndnd,
one must use finesse.

00:15:39.614 --> 00:15:41.740
Coming, gigantums!

00:16:10.311 --> 00:16:12.437
Mmm. That's crisp.

00:16:12.522 --> 00:16:14.356
Yes, but no more so

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:17.025
than your squamous dorsal plates in the moonlight.

00:16:19.112 --> 00:16:21.488
I am experiencing arousal.

00:16:21.614 --> 00:16:23.782
My organs are
moving into position.

00:16:33.501 --> 00:16:36.169
Ndnd, there's something
I've got to tell you.

00:16:36.254 --> 00:16:38.213
What is it?
Is there someone else?

00:16:38.297 --> 00:16:42.050
What? No, no, it's about this takeover of Earth.

00:16:42.135 --> 00:16:43.719
It's... It's...

00:16:43.803 --> 00:16:45.804
The spark that
reignited our marriage?

00:16:46.723 --> 00:16:48.265
Yes! Exactly.

00:16:48.349 --> 00:16:50.600
Good night.

00:17:00.486 --> 00:17:02.404
Oh, lord. Now what?

00:17:02.488 --> 00:17:04.489
I couldn't tell
her the truth.

00:17:04.824 --> 00:17:06.450
Look, you scaly crybaby,

00:17:06.784 --> 00:17:08.952
you do what I say
and you do it now!

00:17:09.036 --> 00:17:10.620
I knew it!

00:17:11.998 --> 00:17:15.333
Frying pans!
Cast-iron frying pans!

00:17:15.626 --> 00:17:17.085
It's not what
it looks like!

00:17:17.336 --> 00:17:18.503
What do I do?

00:17:18.671 --> 00:17:19.796
Do what I say.

00:17:19.881 --> 00:17:21.798
Tell her!
Tell me what?

00:17:22.091 --> 00:17:23.508
Give me the heavy one.

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:28.430
The invasion was all a fake.
I just wanted to impress you.

00:17:28.514 --> 00:17:29.973
You lied?

00:17:30.057 --> 00:17:31.767
What else have you
been hiding from me?

00:17:34.687 --> 00:17:36.855
What else? Nothing else.

00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:38.732
I still want you, Lrrr,

00:17:39.066 --> 00:17:40.859
and I'm willing
to fight for you.

00:17:41.277 --> 00:17:43.695
All I got left is
a colander and a pie pan.

00:17:45.072 --> 00:17:46.198
Lrrr?

00:17:46.324 --> 00:17:50.118
Look, we only had one date.
I barely mated with her.

00:17:50.203 --> 00:17:52.537
Whatever. I harbor no resentment against her.

00:17:55.708 --> 00:17:56.750
What I want to know

00:17:56.834 --> 00:17:59.461
is what is up between you
and Bossy Boots here.

00:17:59.545 --> 00:18:02.130
Her?
She's just a bossy friend.

00:18:02.215 --> 00:18:03.298
Exactly!

00:18:03.382 --> 00:18:05.967
She nagged you, tormented you
and pushed you around.

00:18:06.052 --> 00:18:07.803
That is my job!

00:18:07.887 --> 00:18:09.262
This must be settled.

00:18:09.555 --> 00:18:14.392
I demand the ancient ritual of
Rrrmrrrmrrrfrrrmrrr or Consequences!

00:18:16.270 --> 00:18:18.063
Rrrmrrrmrrrfrrrmrrr or what?

00:18:27.490 --> 00:18:29.115
Let the ritual begin!

00:18:29.492 --> 00:18:31.660
The rules are the same
as in the home version.

00:18:31.744 --> 00:18:35.038
Lrrr must simply choose
between myself and Leela...

00:18:35.414 --> 00:18:36.790
Fine. Hurry up.

00:18:36.874 --> 00:18:38.834
...by shooting
the one he rejects.

00:18:41.003 --> 00:18:42.838
Lrrr, I'm getting angry.

00:18:42.922 --> 00:18:44.297
Don't you go
through with this.

00:18:44.382 --> 00:18:47.634
She is not the boss of you!
I am the boss of you!

00:18:50.012 --> 00:18:51.471
Um... Oh...

00:18:51.848 --> 00:18:53.265
Leela's going to die!

00:18:53.599 --> 00:18:55.350
What would
Delivery-Boy Man do?

00:19:03.109 --> 00:19:04.609
I do not want
to shoot anybody.

00:19:04.986 --> 00:19:06.486
You never want
to do anything!

00:19:06.571 --> 00:19:08.029
Oh, nag, nag, nag.

00:19:08.114 --> 00:19:10.699
You want me to stop nagging?
Then shoot me!

00:19:10.783 --> 00:19:12.200
Oh, you'd like that,
wouldn't you?

00:19:12.285 --> 00:19:14.369
Beats staring at your
fat ass on the couch!

00:19:14.453 --> 00:19:16.162
Oh, yeah? I'll show you!

00:19:18.708 --> 00:19:21.042
Ray-blocking power!

00:19:29.969 --> 00:19:31.094
Fry!

00:19:33.764 --> 00:19:36.892
Lrrr! You were willing to
shoot that bossy temptress!

00:19:36.976 --> 00:19:40.145
You really do value my nagging above all others!

00:19:47.778 --> 00:19:50.363
Good night, dumb prince.

00:19:50.865 --> 00:19:52.616
Come back, Lrrr!

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:54.826
I want to have
your popplers!

00:19:55.202 --> 00:19:57.162
There'll never
be anyone but you!

00:19:58.539 --> 00:19:59.581
Hello.

00:19:59.665 --> 00:20:00.957
Of course I'll marry you.

00:20:01.042 --> 00:20:03.126
Wait,
what the shmell happened?

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:06.171
I thought Ndnd disintegrated
you with this ray gun.

00:20:06.505 --> 00:20:08.465
It's just
a cheap teleporter.

00:20:08.549 --> 00:20:10.342
I bought it out of the back
of a comic book.

00:20:10.426 --> 00:20:11.426
Cha-ching!

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:14.638
The teleporter gun? That
means Fry might still be...

00:20:14.847 --> 00:20:16.514
Fry!
Fry?

00:20:17.725 --> 00:20:18.808
Is this him?

00:20:20.353 --> 00:20:22.270
Fry! You're alive!

00:20:22.355 --> 00:20:23.521
Not only that,

00:20:23.606 --> 00:20:26.816
I now know exactly
how to end my comic book.

00:20:27.193 --> 00:20:28.360
Let's watch.

00:20:28.736 --> 00:20:30.528
Say good-bye
to your forehead,

00:20:30.613 --> 00:20:32.530
because I'm going
to shoot you in it!

00:20:32.615 --> 00:20:35.116
Not if I leap in
front of your death ray,

00:20:35.201 --> 00:20:36.618
and I am going to do that.

00:20:37.036 --> 00:20:38.870
Jumping sound! Ow!

00:20:39.121 --> 00:20:40.413
I didn't shoot yet.

00:20:40.498 --> 00:20:43.708
As usual, your delivery
arrived too soon.

00:20:46.045 --> 00:20:50.882
Oh, Delivery-Boy Man! You
saved me by random chance!

00:20:50.967 --> 00:20:52.926
Don't thank random chance.

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:55.095
Thank my
meteor-wishing power,

00:20:55.388 --> 00:20:56.721
with your lips.

00:21:00.559 --> 00:21:01.601
Good ending.

00:21:01.894 --> 00:21:02.894
Not great.